  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 3rd level, you learn to augment your weapons and armor with mechanical enhancements. During a long rest, you can augment one weapon or one suit of armor you are proficient with. You can have only one augmented item at a time; augmenting a new item ends the previous augmentation.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Weapon Augment.</strong> The weapon gains a +1 bonus to attack and damage rolls, and you can use your Intelligence modifier instead of Strength or Dexterity for attack and damage rolls with it.</li>\n<li><strong>Armor Augment.</strong> The armor gains a +1 bonus to AC, and you can don or doff it as an action.</li>\n</ul>",
